      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "This update is stupid.. one of my Oculus Quest 2 controller at the moment does not want to pair with my headset. This new update made it so both controllers must be connected in order to launch but some people might have broken controllers as well and might not be able to get a controller as wellfix this please this is dumb",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
