      "reactions": null,
      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "This bug prevents players with dead, broken, disconnected, and missing controllers from starting the game on quest headsets. The game has a one-handed mode built in, and has always worked with one controller until now. Sad to see this issue make it to release, but hopefully it is higher priority now that it is impacting more users. \nCurrently have two friends of mine who can not play as of this update. Would appreciate any word on this issue.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
