      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "for some people who tried the beta there are issues with the camera and photos will no longer save. and for some that use EMM that is also broken for them and no longer works. also the menu is super small and for those who have vision impairments it can be hard to see. we should definitely bring back the old stuff.",
