      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{618a19233d4aca5dc98c71ea|full_name}: EMM isn't supported or endorsed by VRChat in any way. If the modification broke, that is not on VRChat to fix. You can get banned for using a modified client. \n(dont give me \"vrc allowed it\", no they did not...)\nPhotos do indeed save! They are sorted into dated folders now to keep your PC from lagging when opening the folder, as well as to keep organized.\nThere is a canny for implementing a way to increase the menu size if you'd like to vote on it:\nhttps://feedback.vrchat.com/open-beta/p/resize-slider-for-new-qm\nThis UI is miles better than the old one. Give it some time and you'll grow on it too. :>",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
