      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "**For users impacted by this bug:**\nLaunch the game and **immediately pull the battery from your controller.** Try to have it disconnect before the game has a chance to load. Once the game shows the login screen you are safe to put the battery back in.\nYou can also use a bluetooth enabled gamepad as a **second controller**, then disconnect the gamepad later after the game is launched. \n(bluetooth supported xbox controllers work, unsure about ds4)\n*Why do these bypass the bug... ?*",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
