      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{5d101e50428ccc1668e70d7c|full_name}: Thank you for your info! I'd like to tell some tips additionally.\nIf you turn \"auto switch for hand tracking\" OFF and disconnect controllers, you can see white dot at the center of your view and can select items pressing \"vol down\" button without controllers. So you don't need a quick action for the first method above.\nI tested on Quest 2 so I don't know it works for Quest 1.\nHere's an article about turning off auto hand tracking switch by Oculus:\nhttps://support.oculus.com/articles/headsets-and-accessories/controllers-and-hand-tracking/hand-tracking-quest-2/\nI hope this helps.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
